%% Source: docs-src/guides/anilist/watchers.md

flowchart TB
    start([Watcher starts]) --> first{since set?}
    first -->|no| baseline[Baseline poll: mark first page seen, yield nothing]
    first -->|yes| poll
    baseline --> wait
    poll[Drain pages to seen frontier<br/>max 10 pages per poll] --> fresh[Collect unseen items<br/>newest first]
    fresh --> yield([Yield items<br/>oldest first]):::out
    yield --> prune[Prune seen ids<br/>to ~3 polls lookback]
    prune --> wait[Wait intervalMs]
    wait --> aborted{signal aborted?}
    aborted -->|yes| stop([Generator ends]):::out
    aborted -->|no| poll

    classDef out fill:#d5e8d4,stroke:#82b366,color:#2d5016;
